	<package>
		<name>MacOS Microsoft Windows App</name>
		<application_name>Windows App</application_name>
		<bundleId>com.microsoft.rdc.macos</bundleId>
		<currentVersionReleaseDate>November 11, 2026</currentVersionReleaseDate>
		<icon_image>https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple221/v4/31/51/6b/31516b5c-e34f-9fdd-aa4a-a7597a2e66b3/AppIcon-0-0-85-220-0-0-6-0-2x.png/512x512bb.png</icon_image>
		<minimumOsVersion>15.0</minimumOsVersion>
		<releaseNotes>In this release we made the following updates:
 
• Added support for launching Cloud PC and Azure Virtual Desktop resources from the Windows App web portal.
• Resolved an issue that caused the "Refresh All Resources" shortcut (Command + R) to sometimes fail after switching tabs.
• Added mitigations to prevent stuck Windows keys in the remote session.
• Resolved an issue where workspace refresh would get stuck when authentication or token acquisition fails.
• Fixed multi-monitor layout and scaling when Retina support is enabled (including mixed-resolution displays).
• Resolved issues with selection highlighting and keyboard focus in the account switcher.
• Improved WebAuthn redirection by resolving passkey registration issues with external security keys.
• Improved reconnection reliability and connection monitoring to help prevent premature session disconnections during network interruptions.
 
In addition, we've also made updates to strengthen security, performance and reliability, and to lay the groundwork for upcoming features.
 
This update requires macOS 15 and later. macOS 14 is no longer supported.
 
If you encounter any errors, you can contact us via Help &gt; Submit Feedback.</releaseNotes>
		<version>11.4.5</version>
		<app_store_url>https://apps.apple.com/us/app/windows-app/id1295203466?mt=12&amp;uo=4</app_store_url>
	</package>
